## Model card

- **Name:** Nemotron 3 Nano Omni
- **Short description:** NVIDIA's open 30B-A3B omni-modal reasoning model with native audio, vision, and text support. Available free via NVIDIA Build API endpoint and as open checkpoints.
- **Provider / access:** NVIDIA Build free API; `opencode/nemotron-3-nano-omni`
- **Release / knowledge:** Part of NVIDIA's Nemotron 3 generation
- **IDs:** `opencode/nemotron-3-nano-omni` (free API via NVIDIA Build)
- **Context window:** 262,144 total (65,536 max output)
- **Modalities:** Text, image, video, audio in; text out
- **Pricing (as of 2026-10-08):** $0 via NVIDIA Build free API endpoint; open checkpoints available for self-hosting
- **Architecture:** 30B-A3B MoE (Mixture of Experts); open-weights model

